IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-X-FUSION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 RANK-R              PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FUSED-RANKS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORAX.
    IF RANK-R == 0 OR DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE RANK-R TO FUSED-RANKS.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY FUSED-RANKS.
    MOVE 32 TO THROUGHPUT-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FUSED-RANKS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
